  "description": "A lightweight, attribute-based dependency injection library for .NET applications. Simplifies service registration with support for singleton, scoped, and transient lifetimes. Features include keyed services (in .NET 8+), decorator pattern support, registration diagnostics, and validation for common DI anti-patterns. Reduce boilerplate code and maintain cleaner application startup with declarative service registration.",
